    <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/datacatalog/id/dataset/5303d670-686b-54c5-85b2-cc13e4208a3c> a dcat:Dataset ;
        dct:accessRights <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC> ;
