    <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/datacatalog/id/dataset/89aa2f91-1ccd-5711-950d-0e8144f52a85> a dcat:Dataset ;
        dct:accessRights <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC> ;
